@startuml t-cabs-devicealert-hierarchy
title T-CABS DeviceAlert Profile Hierarchy (R6 Backport)
hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false

abstract class "DeviceAlert\n(Basic backport)" as Base
abstract class "Event Alarm" as Event
abstract class "Limit Alarm" as Limit

class "Apnea" as Apnea
class "Disconnection" as Disconnection
class "Rebreathing" as Rebreathing
class "Obstruction" as Obstruction
class "Leakage" as Leakage

class "Pressure" as Druck
class "Respiratory Rate" as Atemfrequenz
class "Tidal Volume" as Tidalvolumen
class "Minute Volume" as Minutenvolumen

Base <|-- Event
Base <|-- Limit

Event <|-- Apnea
Event <|-- Disconnection
Event <|-- Rebreathing
Event <|-- Obstruction
Event <|-- Leakage

Limit <|-- Druck
Limit <|-- Atemfrequenz
Limit <|-- Tidalvolumen
Limit <|-- Minutenvolumen

note right of Event
  Specific-event pattern:
  specific IEEE 11073 code,
  no limit reference
end note

note right of Limit
  Limit-event pattern:
  MDC_EVT_HI / MDC_EVT_LO
  + derivedFrom -> Observation
  priority assigned per occurrence
end note

@enduml
